# Binary files, declared as such.
#
# Without this, git guesses. It guessed wrong on the PDF report attached to
# `docs/informe-sourcebook/` and announced that it would rewrite its line
# endings on checkout, which for a PDF means a file that no longer opens.
# The recordings are the same risk with worse consequences: an EDF whose
# 0x0A bytes were rewritten is a corrupted recording, and this repository
# exists partly to say that recordings must not be corrupted silently.

*.pdf   binary
*.edf   binary
*.png   binary
*.jpg   binary
*.jpeg  binary
*.ico   binary
*.docx  binary
*.xlsx  binary
*.exe   binary
*.svg   text eol=lf
